msgctxt "80"
msgid "It's getting kinda chilly. Let's go in, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "I actually think I'm gonna stay out here a little longer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Oh, okay. See you inside!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Don't forget to wipe your feet off before you go in!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Uncle Kaz..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "What's up, Haruka?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Are you... gonna go back to Kamurocho?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "I don't know if I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Huh? Why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"I have a life here now. Responsibilities. I don't have time\r\n"
"to go running off to Tokyo at the drop of a hat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "But if you don't... we're gonna lose the orphanage, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "It's hard to say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"Though one thing's for sure: whoever shot Nakahara was\r\n"
"after the deed for our land."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Rikiya? Little late for a house call, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Sorry, but I've got a favor to ask."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Well, uh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "I wanna go to Kamurocho with you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"I know you're gonna try and get the deed back, Aniki! Which\r\n"
"means findin' the guy who shot the boss!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Please, you've gotta take me with you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Rikiya..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"Oh, and Mikio can stick around the hospital while we're\r\n"
"gone. He's on board if it means us gettin' payback for what\r\n"
"that asshole did to the boss!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "And Saki? What happens to her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Er..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"Look, I'm glad you want revenge for your boss. But who's\r\n"
"gonna be there to look after Saki if you're not around?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "Well, uh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "I could do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Saki-chan can stay with us at the orphanage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "It's not gonna be easy, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"I know. But she's probably been really lonely with her dad\r\n"
"in the hospital and everything. Maybe it'll be good for her\r\n"
"to spend time with other kids for once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "Haruka-chan..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"I'm sure the others would love to have a new friend to play\r\n"
"with, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "Please, Uncle Kaz. I've trusted you all these years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"This time I need you to trust me. We'll take good care of\r\n"
"her. Really."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "Haruka..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8156"
msgid "Haruka"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8160"
msgid "Talk_Yes"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8164"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8168"
msgid "Rikiya"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8172"
msgid "Idle"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8176"
msgid "Talk_OK"
msgstr ""